{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmguqDfBeUbyTpMkzgQE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd go with the one the page picks: open an account at פסגות and buy \"ילין לפידות מחקה S&P 500 (4D)\". The page marks that combo \"הזול\" and says I'd end up with 86,492 ₪ from 70,000 ₪ put in over 10 years. I'm fairly sure, not totally. What decided it was the star plus that big number. The other choices look almost the same or worse, and the minus numbers further down put me off them. First step: open the פסגות account, then put money in that fund every month.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Top of the page:** the heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\" was exactly what I came for, and S&P 500 was already selected. The fields show 10,000 ₪ today and 500 ₪ a month, not my 30,000. This is a screenshot, so I couldn't change them.\n- **The two big boxes:** \"הפקדתם 70,000 ₪\", then \"הבחירה שלכם ★ הזול 86,492 ₪\". The next one was 86,449 ₪ with \"−43 ₪\", basically the same.\n- **One window stayed open the whole way down:** a box called \"מס רק במכירה\" that I never closed. It covered the left side of every screen, and on the first screen it covered the field next to \"שנים\".\n- **The fund card:** \"דמי ניהול 0%\", and next to it \"0.02% נאמן\" (no idea what נאמן is).\n- **The account list on the right:** פסגות 1,057 ₪, then לאומי 4,541 ₪, and further down אלטשולר טרייד 23,790 ₪. So the account fee is the part that matters in shekels.\n- **The long fund list:** I scrolled it fast. It's full of minus amounts like −447 ₪, −1,268 ₪ and −4,492 ₪, plus a load of English iShares/Vanguard funds marked \"אין מחיר כאן\".\n- **Further down:** I skipped \"מה כתוב בפרסום, מול התעריפון\". I glanced at \"מה הכי משנה את מה שיישאר לכם\", where extra years mean 19,116 ₪ more. Then I stopped at the dollar section (\"עם נטרול מט\"ח או בלי\"), because that's where I'd close it.\n\n**Not sure I got right:**\n- Is פסגות + that fund really the cheapest overall, or just cheapest for 10,000 + 500?\n- The \"+0.37%\" next to the fund: is that good?\n- The coloured bars under the accounts: I didn't read the legend, I'm guessing red means fees.\n- The 4D/4A thing and the long list of tags under each fund."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1866,"cache_read_input_tokens":15609,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1866},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aed43e3e-48ed-499a-b178-9f8a916d4dcc","uuid":"02e926e7-d7c6-4241-a25b-6acd5201ae66","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:39:36.613Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmgupz2Ji8AVRc9QE58z"}
